// InboxFeedItem — one comment row in the dashboard feed.
//
// A thin PR context strip (PR title · #num · repo · file:line · chips ·
// author-association badge) sits above the REAL GhComment card — the
// same card the PR-detail Conversation tab uses — so a comment reads
// identically wherever you meet it. The diff an inline comment is
// anchored to rides in GhComment's `diffSlice` slot (under the author
// header, above the body), exactly like the Conversation tab. Mirrors
// the prototype's CIContextStrip + CIFeedItem (comments-inbox.jsx).

